BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2810 Tm (Phomemo app, with Paper in the M834 for a roll \(fed 15.5 mm further so the sheet clears the tear bar\) or fanfold) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2898 Tm (sheets; Settings, under Printers, checks your printer. On a large screen, such as the Tab S8 Ultra or the Fold 7) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 2986 Tm (opened, the result shows the sheet beside the numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3109 Tm (A target GroupLab did not print is marked by hand: choose Mark it by hand when GroupLab asks which target it) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3197 Tm (is. The picture moves under a crosshair that stays in the middle: set the two ends of a length you know and type) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3285 Tm (it, set the aim point, then Add hole here on each hole, with Undo. A mark under the crosshair can be removed;) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3373 Tm (once the scale is known the crosshair's ring is your bullet's size. In GroupLab Dev, the development build, Find) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3461 Tm (holes \(Experimental\) at the holes proposes them, as on the computer: each is a found hole to keep or remove) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3549 Tm (there and to move in Fix holes, and one it is not sure of is ringed in amber and asked about on the result. Fudd) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3637 Tm (buster mode, under a result of twenty shots or more, is the same page as on the computer. Shots, under a result,) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3725 Tm (lists every shot with its offset across and up from the aim point and, with your rifle's click value, the clicks to bring) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3813 Tm (it onto the aim; its Counted switch leaves a shot out of every figure, struck through in the list and dashed on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3901 Tm (picture, and still on the record. Zero from this group says where the group sits, the clicks, whether that is worth) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 3989 Tm (dialing at this many shots, and opens Shots Needed to Zero, or hands the offset to Ballistics, whose dope then) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4077 Tm (includes it at every range. On a target GroupLab did not print, Aim points gives each aim point a chip in its own) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4165 Tm (color, its holes ringed in the same color: tap a chip for that aim point's own figures, or + Aim point to set another;) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4253 Tm (the figures above pool them all. Share a picture, under a result, puts a results box on the picture: drag it) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4341 Tm (anywhere, pinch it or drag its corner to resize it, and tap it to choose its lines. Chips turn the mean radius circle) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4429 Tm (\(drawn about the group's center\) and a label on and off, and set the box's style and the crop; then Save to) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4517 Tm (gallery, which keeps it in Pictures, GroupLab, or Share. Report, under a result, shows the one-page report itself,) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4605 Tm (the PDF's own page, with Share, Save on the phone \(Downloads, GroupLab\) and Print above it. Android's back) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 4693 Tm (button goes back one screen wherever you are, and every page uses the whole width of the screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 56 Tf 1 0 0 -1 3594 5398 Tm (page 20 of 20) Tj ET
